WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:17.240
House of the Dragon is a Game of Thrones prequel
show that is confirmed by HBO’s president

00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:21.360
to air in 2022.
The show is currently casting roles, filming

00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:25.730
begins in January 2021 and the show will air
in 2022.

00:00:25.730 --> 00:00:30.890
It is based on George RR Martin’s book Fire
And Blood volume 1 and on Martin’s yet unfinished

00:00:30.890 --> 00:00:35.290
Fire And Blood volume 2 book.
Miguel Sapochnik and Ryan Condal will serve

00:00:35.290 --> 00:00:40.460
as showrunners and executive producers. George
R. R. Martin will also serve as executive

00:00:40.460 --> 00:00:43.370
producer.
HBO’s spinoff, House of the Dragon, has

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:47.260
also recently announced its first casting
via Entertainment Weekly.

00:00:47.260 --> 00:00:53.089
It is confirmed that English actor Paddy Considine
will star in the prequel as King Viserys I

00:00:53.089 --> 00:00:58.160
Targaryen, the man who began the Targaryen
civil war known as the Dance of the Dragons,

00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:02.390
although he certainly never meant for it to
come to that. This makes him officially the

00:01:02.390 --> 00:01:07.210
first actor cast in the new show, set to land
in 2022.

00:01:07.210 --> 00:01:11.540
The news comes complete with a casting description,
which sounds intriguing by itself:

00:01:11.540 --> 00:01:16.360
“King Viserys Targaryen is chosen by the
lords of Westeros to succeed the Old King,

00:01:16.360 --> 00:01:22.160
Jaehaerys Targaryen, at the Great Council
at Harrenhal. A warm, kind, and decent man,

00:01:22.160 --> 00:01:28.280
Viserys only wishes to carry forward his grandfather’s
legacy. But good men do not necessarily make

00:01:28.280 --> 00:01:32.520
for great kings.”
Viserys I Targaryen was the fifth Targaryen

00:01:32.520 --> 00:01:39.740
king to sit the Iron Throne, ruling from 103
AC to 129 AC. He succeeded his grandfather,

00:01:39.740 --> 00:01:46.250
the Old King Jaehaerys I. Viserys continued
the prosperous peace and legacy of his grandsire,

00:01:46.250 --> 00:01:50.230
but the seeds for the civil war known as the
Dance of the Dragons that would much later

00:01:50.230 --> 00:01:54.160
engulf the realm were inadvertently sown in
his reign.

00:01:54.160 --> 00:02:00.020
Viserys was a dragon rider who rode Balerion
until the dragon died of old age. Viserys

00:02:00.020 --> 00:02:03.310
never bonded with another dragon after Balerion's
death.

00:02:03.310 --> 00:02:08.500
Indeed, King Viserys was known as a decent
guy and ruled Westeros during a largely peaceful

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:13.260
time when the Targaryen dynasty was at its
height. But a succession crisis after his

00:02:13.260 --> 00:02:18.400
death would tear everything apart. To make
a very long story short, after Viserys dies,

00:02:18.400 --> 00:02:22.660
there’s a bitter battle between his daughter
Rhaenyra Targaryen, who he had named to be

00:02:22.660 --> 00:02:28.370
his heir, and his son Aegon Targaryen, Rhaenyra’s
half-brother born of another wife after Rhaenyra’s

00:02:28.370 --> 00:02:32.541
mother had died. This was the Dance of the
Dragons, and it’s what House of the Dragon

00:02:32.541 --> 00:02:35.560
will cover.
The Dance of the Dragons was the most devastating

00:02:35.560 --> 00:02:40.290
war in the history of the Seven Kingdoms.
A war of succession between Aegon II and his

00:02:40.290 --> 00:02:44.060
half-sister Rhaenyra over their father Viserys
I's throne.

00:02:44.060 --> 00:02:48.811
By the end of the reign of King Viserys I
Targaryen, twenty dragons were alive. The

00:02:48.811 --> 00:02:53.180
majority of these died during the civil war
called the Dance of the Dragons, which began

00:02:53.180 --> 00:03:01.820
in 129 AC and lasted until mid 131 AC.
EW also confirms some other roles HBO is currently

00:03:01.820 --> 00:03:05.730
casting:
—Princess Rhaenyra Targaryen: “King Viserys’

00:03:05.730 --> 00:03:11.160
chosen heir, a dragon rider who grew up expecting
to become the first ruling Queen of Westeros.”

00:03:11.160 --> 00:03:17.160
—Queen Alicent Hightower: “Viserys’
ambitious second wife and Rhaenyra’s stepmother,

00:03:17.160 --> 00:03:19.640
who had three children of her own with the
king.”

00:03:19.640 --> 00:03:24.940
—Aegon II Targaryen: “Princess Rhaenyra’s
younger half-brother who challenges Rhaenyra’s

00:03:24.940 --> 00:03:30.240
claim to the throne, igniting a civil war.”
—Prince Daemon Targaryen: “Rhaenyra’s

00:03:30.240 --> 00:03:34.410
uncle, an experienced warrior.”
It is now officially confirmed that Game of

00:03:34.410 --> 00:03:38.480
Thrones prequel series, House of the Dragon,
will start with a build-up towards the Dance

00:03:38.480 --> 00:03:43.959
of the Dragons and early seasons will cover
the prelude to and the actual Targaryen civil

00:03:43.959 --> 00:03:46.970
war.
Later seasons however will be based on George

00:03:46.970 --> 00:03:50.410
RR Martin's yet unfinished Fire And Blood
volume 2 book.

00:03:50.410 --> 00:03:54.071
Let me remind you that Game of Thrones prequel
show is based on the book Fire And Blood book

00:03:54.071 --> 00:03:58.560
which has 2 parts, volume 1 as well as the
yet unfinished volume 2.

00:03:58.560 --> 00:04:02.930
The released Fire And Blood volume 1 book
covers the history of House Targaryen from

00:04:02.930 --> 00:04:07.600
the Targaryen conquest, Aegon's Conquest of
the Seven Kingdoms of Westeros to the dying

00:04:07.600 --> 00:04:13.080
of the dragons, the great civil war known
as the Dance of the Dragons and its aftermath,

00:04:13.080 --> 00:04:18.319
the reign of Rhaenyra's young son Aegon lll.
The yet unreleased Fire And Blood volume 2

00:04:18.319 --> 00:04:22.840
book will continue with the reign of Aegon
lll known as the Dragonsbane for the last

00:04:22.840 --> 00:04:28.400
dragon died during his reign and will continue
with his sons after him including the famous

00:04:28.400 --> 00:04:33.820
Daeron the Young Dragon, a 14-year-old Alexander
the Great figure who conquered what Aegon

00:04:33.820 --> 00:04:39.440
the Conqueror failed to conquer - Dorne but
died in the process. Then it will continue

00:04:39.440 --> 00:04:45.310
with King Baelor the Blessed and a brief reign
of Viserys ll. After that, Aegon lV known

00:04:45.310 --> 00:04:50.130
as Aegon the Unworthy who's reign is a build-up
towards the Blackfyre rebellions when he legitimized

00:04:50.130 --> 00:04:55.300
his bastard son Daemon, giving him Blackfyre
surname after he gave him the famous Targaryen

00:04:55.300 --> 00:05:01.620
sword Blackfyre. When Aegon lV dies, his Targaryen
children have to face a rebellion and defend

00:05:01.620 --> 00:05:05.720
the realm from the Blackfyres.
Final seasons of Game of Thrones prequel show

00:05:05.720 --> 00:05:10.080
could include all of that and more - Roberts
Rebellion, the fall of the great Targaryen

00:05:10.080 --> 00:05:13.100
dynasty as Fire And Blood volume 2 book will
cover as well.

00:05:13.100 --> 00:05:18.280
How do I know the second part of the Targaryen
history will cover all that? Because George

00:05:18.280 --> 00:06:19.050
RR Martin himself revealed it.
If 

00:06:19.050 --> 00:07:45.020
the show 
was 

00:07:45.020 --> 00:07:49.451
only based on Fire And Blood volume 1 book,
then it would have few seasons because the

00:07:49.451 --> 00:07:53.800
show will only cover second part of Fire And
Blood volume 1.

00:07:53.800 --> 00:07:57.630
Confirmed by casting news to start with the
build-up to the Dance of the Dragons, and

00:07:57.630 --> 00:08:03.130
of course, the Targaryen civil war itself,
which means the show will only use about 370

00:08:03.130 --> 00:08:08.080
pages out of Fire And Blood volume 1 book.
In comparison, the book material Game of Thrones

00:08:08.080 --> 00:08:14.630
show used was 4000 pages with the additional
summary from George RR Martin about the ending.

00:08:14.630 --> 00:08:19.881
If this prequel show is going to run 10 or
more seasons as many expect and as HBO and

00:08:19.881 --> 00:08:24.600
George RR Martin themselves probably want
just as they wanted Game of Thrones, or if

00:08:24.600 --> 00:08:28.790
at least this show is going to run as long
as Game of Thrones did, then the show will

00:08:28.790 --> 00:08:34.599
have to use more than 370 pages of book material
and will likely cover Fire And Blood volume

00:08:34.599 --> 00:08:38.110
2 book, to what extent though we do not know
for sure.

00:08:38.110 --> 00:08:43.419
It could go on to cover Aegon lll’s reign
and his son’s Daeron ll reign, a character

00:08:43.419 --> 00:08:48.520
who was based on Alexander the Great, Daeron
conquered what Aegon the Conqueror failed

00:08:48.520 --> 00:08:52.560
to conquer - Dorne.
It could also go on to Aegon IV’s reign

00:08:52.560 --> 00:08:57.430
and cover the Blackfyre Rebellions as it is
also something fans are eager to know more

00:08:57.430 --> 00:09:02.150
of and watch, or it could go all the way to
the fall of the Targaryen dynasty as the book

00:09:02.150 --> 00:09:06.560
Fire And Blood volume 2 will, and cover Robert’s
Rebellion itself.

00:09:06.560 --> 00:09:11.630
This makes the show even more mysterious and
leaves us in dark because we don't have Fire

00:09:11.630 --> 00:09:16.840
And Blood volume 2 nor will it be released
anytime soon with George RR Martin currently

00:09:16.840 --> 00:09:20.890
focusing on The Winds of Winter.
This would leave us spoiler-free for the later

00:09:20.890 --> 00:09:25.620
seasons of House of the Dragon, although we
don't have much spoilers going into the show

00:09:25.620 --> 00:09:29.560
in the first place really, or at least not
from the books.

00:09:29.560 --> 00:09:33.340
Some would think that you could just read
the book Fire &amp; Blood to know what will happen

00:09:33.340 --> 00:09:38.580
in the show based on that very same book but
that's far from the truth. Why?

00:09:38.580 --> 00:09:42.830
Because let me remind you that Fire And Blood
is not a non-conventional novel, it is an

00:09:42.830 --> 00:09:47.940
imaginary history book of House Targaryen
written by George R. R. Martin from the perspective

00:09:47.940 --> 00:09:52.910
of Archmaester Gyldayn who wrote it many decades
after the events took place, and according

00:09:52.910 --> 00:10:32.950
to George RR Martin himself, not very accurate
at that.

00:10:32.950 --> 00:10:37.390
Because while Fire And blood book was written
by George RR Martin, it wasn't written from

00:10:37.390 --> 00:10:43.060
him as facts, but rather through the perspective
of the Citadel's Archmaester Gyldayn who gathered

00:10:43.060 --> 00:10:47.500
all the info and as many different sources
as he could and used it to write a book about

00:10:47.500 --> 00:10:53.330
the Targaryen history. Some info is fake,
some info is true, some info is semi-true.

00:10:53.330 --> 00:10:57.870
No one will know for a fact what was happening
in real history until the House of the Dragon

00:10:57.870 --> 00:11:36.899
airs 

00:11:36.899 --> 00:13:12.670
in 2022.
The show unlike the book will contain truth,

00:13:12.670 --> 00:13:17.769
it will depict what actually happened, not
the changed history, fake or semi-true, not

00:13:17.769 --> 00:13:21.541
what might or might not have happened.
It is confirmed that the House of the Dragon

00:13:21.541 --> 00:13:26.410
show will start with prelude to the Targaryen
civil war but it is and will be for a long

00:13:26.410 --> 00:13:29.660
time unknown to what extent will the show
go.

00:13:29.660 --> 00:13:33.779
Many thought the show was going to start with
Aegon’s Conquest and go to the Dance of

00:13:33.779 --> 00:13:36.610
the Dragons.
There is roughly the same time difference

00:13:36.610 --> 00:13:41.010
between that and between the Dance of the
Dragons and the end of the Targaryen dynasty

00:13:41.010 --> 00:13:45.480
that ended with Robert’s Rebellion.
There is a high possibility that in the final

00:13:45.480 --> 00:13:49.980
season of the Targaryen prequel series we
could see Robert’s rebellion and finally

00:13:49.980 --> 00:13:54.889
get answers to all the questions we have.
Daenerys being born and smuggled into exile

00:13:54.889 --> 00:13:59.930
to escape Robert’s wrath could be the final
scene of the House of the Dragon show.

